      "pText": "Wiggle is a swing with two round nest seats in place of flat ones. The A-frame legs are brown, and the top beam and chains are Play Orange. A nest seat lets a child sit, kneel or lie down, which suits children who are not yet sure of themselves on a flat seat. Wiggle is listed for 2 users, one per seat. The frame covers 12'11\" x 9' and the safe play area is 18'11\" x 15'. Skills listed are confidence building and social skills. It is part of our NexLev Woody series and suits parks, societies and preschools. Our warranty is 3 years on galvanised pipe, composite laminates and play rope, and 1 year on bearings and spare parts. Call +91 902 830 2266 to add Wiggle to your layout."
